<title>ITALY: Italian bond futures rise to new record high.</title>
<headline>Italian bond futures rise to new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's BTP September LIFFE futures contract hit a new record high of 135.25 on Thursday before slipping back to 135.21, bond traders said.</p>
<p>The spread between BTPs and the benchmark Bund contract narrowed to 103 basis points.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
